msgstr "De PDF-Datei nöömt de TeX-Datei <strong>%1</strong> as Betog, man de lett sik nich finnen."

#: pdfRenderer.cpp:740
msgid "Could Not Find File"
msgstr "Datei lett sik nich finnen"

#: pdfRenderer.cpp:748
msgid ""
"You have not yet specified an editor for inverse search. Please choose your "
"favorite editor in the <strong>PDF options dialog</strong> which you will "
"find in the <strong>Settings</strong>-menu."
msgstr "Betherto hest Du noch keen Editor för de Ümdreihte Söök fastleggt. Söök bitte Dien vörtrocken Editor binnen den Dialoog <strong>PDF-Optschonen</strong> ut. De findt sik in't Menü <strong>Instellen</strong>."

#: pdfRenderer.cpp:753
msgid "Need to Specify Editor"
msgstr "Du muttst en Editor angeven"

#: pdfRenderer.cpp:754
msgid "Use KDE's Editor Kate for Now"
msgstr "Eerstmaal den KDE-Editor \"Kate\" bruken"

#: pdfRenderer.cpp:778
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt>You have asked Ligature to jump to theline %1 in the TeX-file <strong>%"
"2</strong>,but Ligature was not able to start the selected texteditor.Please "
"choose a texteditor in the Configuration Dialog that isinstalled on your "
"system.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>Du wullt, dat Ligature na de Reeg %1 binnen de TeX-Datei <strong>%2</strong> geiht, man de utsöchte Texteditor lett sik nich opropen. Söök bitte binnen den Instellendialoog en Editor ut, de op Dien Systeem installeert is.</qt>"

#: pdfRenderer.cpp:783
msgid "Could Not Open Texteditor"
msgstr "Texteditor lett sik nich opmaken"

#: pdfRenderer.cpp:804
msgid "Ligature: Information"
msgstr "Ligature: Informatschoon"

#: pdfRenderer.cpp:820
msgid ""
"<qt>A pdfsync file has been found. You may click into the text with the "
"middle mouse button, and an editor will open the TeX-source file immediately."
"</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>Dat gifft en pdfsync-Datei. Du kannst mit den Middelmuusknoop binnen den Text klicken, denn geiht fuurts en Texteditor mit de TeX-Borndatei op.</qt>"

#: pdfRenderer.cpp:827
msgid "Do not show this message again"
msgstr "Disse Mellen nich nochmaal wiesen"

#: pdfRenderer.cpp:830
msgid "Explain in more detail..."
msgstr "Enkelheiten verkloren..."

#: pdfRenderer.cpp:892
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt>You have asked Ligature to locate the place in the PDF file which "
"corresponds to line %1 in the TeX-file <strong>%2</strong>. It seems, "
"however, that there does not exist a corresponding pdfsync file, which "
"contains the necessary source file information. We refer to the manual of "
"Ligature for a detailed explanation on how to include this information. "
"Press the F1 key to open the manual.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>Du wullt, dat Ligature de Steed binnen de PDF-Datei findt, de de Reeg %1 binnen de TeX-Datei <strong>%2</strong> tohöört. Man dat gifft kenn tohören pdfsync-Datei, as't lett. Disse Datei bargt de Informatschonen över de Borndatei. Binnen dat Ligature-Handbook gifft en ümfaten Verkloren, wodennig Du disse Informatschonen infögen kannst. Drück de F1-Tast, wenn Du dat Handbook opmaken wullt.</qt>"

#: pdfRenderer.cpp:897
msgid "Could Not Find Reference"
msgstr "Betog lett sik nich finnen"

#: pdfRenderer.cpp:974
msgid "Document Properties"
msgstr "Dokmentegenschappen"

#: pdfRenderer.cpp:1081 pdfRenderer.cpp:1165 pdfRenderer.cpp:1257
#: pdfRenderer.cpp:1350
msgid ""
"<qt>An error occurred. The command <strong>pdftk</strong> could not be "
"started, and the background could not be set.</qt>"
msgstr "<qt>Dat geev en Fehler. Dat Programm <strong>pdftk</strong> lett sik nich opropen, de Achtergrund lett sik nich fastleggen.</qt>"

#: pdfRenderer.cpp:1083 pdfRenderer.cpp:1167 pdfRenderer.cpp:1259
#: pdfRenderer.cpp:1352
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>This error occurs most likely because the program <strong>pdftk</strong>, "
"which is part of the PDF toolkit, is not installed on your computer. If you "
"believe the toolkit is installed, you could try to start the <strong>pdftk</"
"strong> command from the shell in order to check that.</p><p>The PDF toolkit "
"can be downloaded for free from http://www.accesspdf.com/pdftk.</p><p>The "
"following paths were tried to locate the <strong>pdftk</strong> program: %1</"
"p>"
msgstr "<p>Disse Fehler dukt tomehrst denn op, wenn dat Programm <strong>pdftk</strong>, dat Deel vun den PDF-Warktüüchkasten is, nich op Dien Reekner installeert is. Man is de Warktüüchkasten na Dien Verscheel op Dien Reekner istalleert, versöök dat un roop <strong>pdftk</strong> op de Konsool op, so kannst Du dat pröven.</p><p>Du kannst den PDF-Warktüüchkasten ümsunst vun http://www.accesspdf.com/pdftk daalladen.</p><p>Binnen disse Padden wöör na <strong>pdftk</strong> söcht: %1</p>"

