msgstr "Saak vun't Dokment"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file documentInfoWidget_base.ui line 69
#: rc.cpp:12
msgid ""
"<p>Use this text field to specify the <b>subject of the current document</"
"b>. Other programs can then use this information to help you organize your "
"files. If you publish the document on the internet, the information is also "
"used by search engines, such as Google.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>If you make any changes here, click the Ok button below to apply the "
"modification to the document. You will have to save the document if you wish "
"to modify the file permanently.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p><b>Note:</b> Currently only western European characters can be used "
"here.  Other scripts, such as Chinese, are not supported, and special "
"symbold will also not work.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Binnen dit Textfeld kannst Du de <b>Saak</b> angeven, wo sik dat Dokment üm dreiht. Anner Programmen köönt disse Informatschoon bruken un Di hölpen, dat Du Dien Dokmenten organiseert kriggst. Maakst Du dat Dokment in't Internet apen, warrt disse Informatschonen ok vun Söökmaschinen as Google bruukt.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Ännerst Du hier wat, klick bitte op den OK-Knoop, denn warrt de Ännern na't Dokment övernahmen. Wullt Du de Ännern duerhaftig wohren, seker dat Dokment bitte.</p>\n"
"\n"
"<p><b>Beacht bitte:</b>Opstunns laat sik hier bloots westeuropääsch Bookstaven bruken. Anner Schriften, as Chineesch, warrt nich ünnerstütt, un ok Sünnersymbolen funkscheneert nich.</p>"

